    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "For elements of art, I used primarily color, or emphasis of one color in order to make this project mean something. The excessive and exclusive use of green is what makes this piece exist. For principles of design, I used variety through the varied newspaper clippings, and the varied green painted pieces placed on top.",
